WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
services, Mr. Trevor Reagan.

00:00:20.305 --> 00:00:22.325
>> [music]

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.400
>> Good afternoon.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.200
I'm Trevor Reagan, and I lead

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.200
humanitarian services for the American

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.900
Red Cross. But before I get started

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.800
today, I want to say a special thank you

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:36.100
to First Lady Melania Trump

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.400
and Second Lady Usha Vance for their

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:40.400
presence here today. Being here creates

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.300
so much attention on our service members

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.800
and their families that are so

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.400
desperately needed.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:47.700
And also to our base and wing commanders

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.400
at Joint Joint Base Andrews,

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:51.700
we thank you for your presence and for

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.800
your leadership.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:56.300
For more than 145 years, the American

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:57.400
Red Cross has stood beside the military

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.100
community.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:02.800
But today really isn't about history.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:04.400
Today is about people, people who serve,

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:06.300
people who wait at home,

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.900
and people who step forward when help is

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:10.200
needed.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.500
For our service members here today,

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.700
we know some of you may not get home for

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.800
the holidays. Some are just coming off a

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:18.000
deployment, some heading to deployment,

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:20.200
and many are balancing the pressures of

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.600
family life with military service

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.400
in a way most of us will never

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:27.600
understand.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.600
We see you and we are grateful.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:32.400
Now today, this special event we're here

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:34.500
to do together, in a few moments we'll

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:36.800
start putting together comfort kits and

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:39.200
sign holiday cards, and really it's all

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:40.700
about one very simple message.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.300
To those troops overseas, these cards

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:44.400
will go to

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:47.100
you're not alone, and we are thinking of

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:48.400
you throughout this holiday season.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:50.200
Now in my time with the Red Cross, I've

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.800
realized that service is not just an

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:54.000
individual commitment,

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:55.100
it's also a family commitment.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.200
And as the wife of a Marine Corps

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:58.400
veteran,

00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:00.892
Mrs. Vance understands the personal

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:02.692
connections in that tradition, but also

00:02:00.892 --> 00:02:04.592
appreciates the service of our military

00:02:02.692 --> 00:02:05.892
members and the sacrifice

00:02:04.592 --> 00:02:07.192
that their family makes every single

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:09.092
day.

00:02:07.192 --> 00:02:13.092
So please join me in welcoming our

00:02:09.092 --> 00:02:13.092
nation's second lady, Usha Vance.

00:02:16.896 --> 00:02:18.916
>> [music]

00:02:22.136 --> 00:02:24.156
[music]

00:02:26.721 --> 00:02:28.741
[music]

00:02:30.192 --> 00:02:33.992
>> Hello everyone. It's my pleasure to be

00:02:32.392 --> 00:02:35.292
here with you today.

00:02:33.992 --> 00:02:37.292
I'm so delighted that we have the

00:02:35.292 --> 00:02:39.192
opportunity to reconvene this holiday

00:02:37.292 --> 00:02:41.292
season and give back to our men and

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:43.792
women in uniform.

00:02:41.292 --> 00:02:45.292
I want to start by thanking Trevor Regan

00:02:43.792 --> 00:02:47.592
and the rest of the team at the American

00:02:45.292 --> 00:02:50.292
Red Cross for all their work in keeping

00:02:47.592 --> 00:02:51.892
our nation healthy and safe.

00:02:50.292 --> 00:02:53.792
And I'd like to offer my gratitude

00:02:51.892 --> 00:02:57.192
specifically to the Americans serving

00:02:53.792 --> 00:02:59.192
right here at Joint Base Andrews.

00:02:57.192 --> 00:03:01.392
Over the last two years, JD and I have

00:02:59.192 --> 00:03:03.592
come to know the base very well.

00:03:01.392 --> 00:03:05.792
And I can't overstate how incredibly

00:03:03.592 --> 00:03:07.992
kind and helpful everyone stationed here

00:03:05.792 --> 00:03:09.892
has been to our family, as well as to

00:03:07.992 --> 00:03:11.992
all the staff members and guests who

00:03:09.892 --> 00:03:13.592
pass through its gates.

00:03:11.992 --> 00:03:15.592
We always look forward to our visits to

00:03:13.592 --> 00:03:17.792
America's airfield, and today is no

00:03:15.592 --> 00:03:19.192
exception.

00:03:17.792 --> 00:03:20.492
And with just three days until

00:03:19.192 --> 00:03:21.992
Thanksgiving,

00:03:20.492 --> 00:03:23.892
the first lady and I are particularly

00:03:21.992 --> 00:03:26.192
grateful to be here and to take part in

00:03:23.892 --> 00:03:27.892
a tradition that dates back well over a

00:03:26.192 --> 00:03:29.492
century.

00:03:27.892 --> 00:03:31.092
This morning, we're joining with

00:03:29.492 --> 00:03:32.992
military spouses from the base to

00:03:31.092 --> 00:03:35.192
assemble care packages for members of

00:03:32.992 --> 00:03:38.392
our armed forces currently serving

00:03:35.192 --> 00:03:40.292
deployments away from their loved ones.

00:03:38.392 --> 00:03:41.892
Each year, the Red Cross spearheads this

00:03:40.292 --> 00:03:44.092
effort.

00:03:41.892 --> 00:03:45.892
It's a simple, elegant way of expressing

00:03:44.092 --> 00:03:47.892
gratitude to the Americans who put their

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:49.792
nation before themselves

00:03:47.892 --> 00:03:51.392
and reminding them that even when

00:03:49.792 --> 00:03:54.492
they're far from home,

00:03:51.392 --> 00:03:55.892
their country has not forgotten them.

00:03:54.492 --> 00:03:57.692
I hope these packages serve as a

00:03:55.892 --> 00:04:00.792
reminder that their sacrifices are

00:03:57.692 --> 00:04:02.594
deeply appreciated and that their nation

00:04:00.792 --> 00:04:04.694
and our family looks forward to them

00:04:02.594 --> 00:04:06.594
back home.

00:04:04.694 --> 00:04:08.694
But before I step away,

00:04:06.594 --> 00:04:10.294
I'd like to thank someone who is deeply

00:04:08.694 --> 00:04:13.194
committed to the well-being of our

00:04:10.294 --> 00:04:15.094
service members and their loved ones.

00:04:13.194 --> 00:04:17.194
Our First Lady has made supporting

00:04:15.094 --> 00:04:19.194
America's children and families,

00:04:17.194 --> 00:04:21.594
including and especially those who serve

00:04:19.194 --> 00:04:23.594
in our military, a central part of her

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:25.494
leadership.

00:04:23.594 --> 00:04:27.794
It's a great privilege to join her in

00:04:25.494 --> 00:04:29.694
this tradition once again. So, ladies

00:04:27.794 --> 00:04:31.294
and gentlemen, please join me in

00:04:29.694 --> 00:04:34.894
welcoming the First Lady of the United

00:04:31.294 --> 00:04:34.894
States, Melania Trump.

00:04:35.103 --> 00:04:37.123
>> [music]

00:04:44.273 --> 00:04:46.293
[music]

00:04:50.168 --> 00:04:52.188
[music]

00:04:57.373 --> 00:04:59.393
[music]

00:05:01.594 --> 00:05:06.294
>> Good afternoon.

00:05:03.394 --> 00:05:09.194
Thank you, Usha, for your kind words and

00:05:06.294 --> 00:05:11.194
for the dedication and service that you

00:05:09.194 --> 00:05:14.094
and the Vice President,

00:05:11.194 --> 00:05:17.694
a proud United States Marine veteran,

00:05:14.094 --> 00:05:20.894
have provided to our nation.

00:05:17.694 --> 00:05:23.394
It is an honor to be welcomed by all of

00:05:20.894 --> 00:05:25.794
the members of our armed forces and

00:05:23.394 --> 00:05:28.894
their beautiful families here

00:05:25.794 --> 00:05:30.994
at Joint Base Andrews.

00:05:28.894 --> 00:05:33.494
I'm delighted to share this special

00:05:30.994 --> 00:05:36.794
afternoon with you.

00:05:33.494 --> 00:05:40.094
And thank you to the spouses of our

00:05:36.794 --> 00:05:44.194
cabinet members who have joined me today

00:05:40.094 --> 00:05:44.194
to support America's military.

00:05:44.394 --> 00:05:52.694
Perfect precision is not an accident.

00:05:49.194 --> 00:05:53.894
It is the result of repetition, measured

00:05:52.694 --> 00:05:56.894
pacing,

00:05:53.894 --> 00:05:59.494
and flawless execution.

00:05:56.894 --> 00:06:01.794
The US military is the most powerful

00:05:59.494 --> 00:06:03.394
military in the world because of its

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:06.595
people.

00:06:03.394 --> 00:06:09.295
Our warriors train

00:06:06.595 --> 00:06:11.795
pushing the boundaries of physical and

00:06:09.295 --> 00:06:15.095
mental strength.

00:06:11.795 --> 00:06:17.295
Every moment is deliberate. Everything

00:06:15.095 --> 00:06:19.595
is designed to achieve overpowering

00:06:17.295 --> 00:06:22.095
military superiority

00:06:19.595 --> 00:06:25.195
through relentless training, technical

00:06:22.095 --> 00:06:28.395
mastery, and a very measured approach to

00:06:25.195 --> 00:06:32.695
everything they do. Our warriors make

00:06:28.395 --> 00:06:35.795
the very complex look effortless.

00:06:32.695 --> 00:06:37.695
But I know our military is not a

00:06:35.795 --> 00:06:39.895
machine.

00:06:37.695 --> 00:06:42.895
It's made up of human

00:06:39.895 --> 00:06:45.695
beings, sons and daughters

00:06:42.895 --> 00:06:47.095
who are taking on this inherently big

00:06:45.695 --> 00:06:49.995
risk.

00:06:47.095 --> 00:06:52.995
Our brave men and women have families

00:06:49.995 --> 00:06:54.395
who are praying for their safety every

00:06:52.995 --> 00:06:56.795
day.

00:06:54.395 --> 00:06:58.095
Those families know that absolute

00:06:56.795 --> 00:07:01.095
precision

00:06:58.095 --> 00:07:03.295
and coordination are vital to protecting

00:07:01.095 --> 00:07:07.595
the people they love.

00:07:03.295 --> 00:07:10.695
There is no room for mistakes.

00:07:07.595 --> 00:07:13.295
Our warriors are united by a vision

00:07:10.695 --> 00:07:16.395
greater than themselves.

00:07:13.295 --> 00:07:20.095
Each individual contributes to a larger

00:07:16.395 --> 00:07:22.595
plan with their fellow warriors.

00:07:20.095 --> 00:07:24.295
They have unwavering trust in each

00:07:22.595 --> 00:07:29.295
other.

00:07:24.295 --> 00:07:31.795
There cannot be any accidents.

00:07:29.295 --> 00:07:33.995
We must always remember that their

00:07:31.795 --> 00:07:37.195
service is not just about the

00:07:33.995 --> 00:07:39.495
transaction of a single mission.

00:07:37.195 --> 00:07:41.195
It is about the future of our children

00:07:39.495 --> 00:07:43.595
and grandchildren.

00:07:41.195 --> 00:07:44.895
It is about maintaining America's lead

00:07:43.595 --> 00:07:47.895
position

00:07:44.895 --> 00:07:51.295
in the world, creating opportunities for

00:07:47.895 --> 00:07:54.795
American ingenuity and innovation,

00:07:51.295 --> 00:07:57.495
and preserving the safety and freedom of

00:07:54.795 --> 00:07:59.895
future generations.

00:07:57.495 --> 00:08:01.195
Our leaders do not always talk about

00:07:59.895 --> 00:08:03.995
this,

00:08:01.195 --> 00:08:09.197
but we must always remember this is the

00:08:03.995 --> 00:08:09.197
end result of our military action.

00:08:09.597 --> 00:08:15.797
The American Red Cross assists member of

00:08:12.997 --> 00:08:18.497
the military and their families.

00:08:15.797 --> 00:08:20.497
And for this I'm grateful.

00:08:18.497 --> 00:08:23.297
They serve troops and their families

00:08:20.497 --> 00:08:25.297
worldwide. And today's tradition will

00:08:23.297 --> 00:08:27.697
deliver packages filled with warm

00:08:25.297 --> 00:08:30.297
holiday season wishes

00:08:27.697 --> 00:08:32.697
made with love which will be well

00:08:30.297 --> 00:08:35.997
received.

00:08:32.697 --> 00:08:37.697
The strength of our military helps us

00:08:35.997 --> 00:08:40.297
prevent wars.

00:08:37.697 --> 00:08:43.597
We perfect our capabilities

00:08:40.297 --> 00:08:46.897
to protect human life, preserve peace,

00:08:43.597 --> 00:08:49.297
and secure our nation's future.

00:08:46.897 --> 00:08:52.197
This high level of precision

00:08:49.297 --> 00:08:55.097
of our armed forces sends an

00:08:52.197 --> 00:08:56.397
unmistakable message to the rest of the

00:08:55.097 --> 00:09:01.897
world.

00:08:56.397 --> 00:09:01.897
America's children must inherit peace.

00:09:02.197 --> 00:09:06.097
I wish America a very happy

00:09:04.497 --> 00:09:09.197
Thanksgiving,

00:09:06.097 --> 00:09:10.797
safety and peace during this upcoming

00:09:09.197 --> 00:09:12.826
holiday season.

00:09:10.797 --> 00:09:14.846
Thank you.

00:09:12.826 --> 00:09:14.846
>> [applause]

