>> I

00:14:23.701 --> 00:14:25.801
>> Hello.

00:18:28.903 --> 00:18:31.003
>> It

00:20:30.905 --> 00:20:33.005
>> I

00:24:36.707 --> 00:24:38.908
>> This is

00:26:39.309 --> 00:26:41.409
>> Hello.

00:35:29.714 --> 00:35:31.814
>> Okay.

00:38:44.717 --> 00:38:46.717
>> I

00:45:42.721 --> 00:45:44.821
>> I
